# GitLab access

- This project is hosted on **GitLab**, not GitHub.
- Remote: `https://gitlab.com/l2journey/l2journey`
- Always use **`glab`**. Never use `gh` for this repo.
- Default assignee for MRs: `zoiosilva`
- When the user says “PR” / “pull request” / “checks”, treat that as **MR / GitLab pipeline**.

## Common commands

```bash
# Auth / identity
glab auth status
glab api user

# Create MR (PowerShell)
glab mr create --assignee zoiosilva --title "…" --description @"
## Summary
- …

## Test plan
- [ ] …
"@

# Inspect MR / CI
glab mr view
glab ci status
glab api "projects/l2journey%2Fl2journey/merge_requests/<iid>/pipelines"
```

- CI is defined in `.gitlab-ci.yml`; the main job is `unit-test` (`ant test`).
